asteroid it hits into glowing purple rubble"}}}}}},{"type":"ev_click","id":"b0b3d520z4j3r","x":0,"y":676,"next":{"block":{"type":"ga_do","id":"b4e22614z5w1o","fields":{"ACTION":"fire a bright cyan laser bolt straight ahead that shatters the first asteroid it hits into glowing purple rubble"}}}},{"type":"ev_touch","id":"b5j023q3i1x3n","x":0,"y":901,"inputs":{"WHO":{"shadow":{"type":"char_menu","id":"b3c3f5e3x1l1d","fields":{"NAME":"anyone"}},"block":{"type":"char_ref","id":"b0468313i1d1n","fields":{"NAME":"Asteroid"}}}},"next":{"block":{"type":"fl_if","id":"b02454u07284y","inputs":{"COND":{"block":{"type":"cd_words","id":"b3y0j603r302e","fields":{"TEXT":"I'm not blinking"}}},"SUBSTACK":{"block":{"type":"so_play","id":"b640k4v2l3h0h","fields":{"SOUND":"hit"},"next":{"block":{"type":"kit_shake","id":"b4q310x1v2t43","next":{"block":{"type":"ga_effect","id":"b2i0t3t2u2k4e","fields":{"HOW":"a burst of hot pink sparks"},"next":{"block":{"type":"ga_do","id":"b6d4x2w6l5p29","fields":{"ACTION":"lose a life, then blink for 1 second (asteroids can't hurt me while I blink)"}}}}}}}}}}}}}]}},"x":-150,"y":0,"z":0,"size":100,"direction":0,"visible":true,"rotationStyle":"all around"},{"id":"t1k3a0f1k4a65","kind":"sprite","name":"Asteroid","description":"A spinning space rock with a neon pink rim. The comet can blast it with its laser.","costumes":[{"id":"a2l671i0b3759","name":"rock","kind":"image","dataUrl":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","mime":"image/svg+xml","width":60,"height":56,"resolution":1,"centerX":30,"centerY":28}],"sounds":[],"currentCostume":0,"blocks":{"blocks":{"languageVersion":0,"blocks":[{"type":"ev_start","id":"b642j2y4l4b14","next":{"block":{"type":"lo_hide","id":"b495622313j6a","next":{"block":{"type":"co_forever","id":"b6l0x39554q6f","inputs":{"SUBSTACK":{"block":{"type":"cp_make","id":"b11672j3x4y3o","inputs":{"WHO":{"shadow":{"type":"char_menu","id":"b2t394v2p5o6w","fields":{"NAME":"me"}}}},"next":{"block":{"type":"fl_wait","id":"b4x0t0w0i2f0c","inputs":{"SECONDS":{"shadow":{"type":"sh_num","id":"b5k1r0f5e2t2r","fields":{"NUM":"1"}},"block":{"type":"nm_words","id":"b3g381c600l2f","fields":{"TEXT":"a little less time each wave, starting at 1 second"}}}}}}}}}}}}},"x":24,"y":24},{"type":"ev_created","id":"b731t3n4d4m5q","next":{"block":{"type":"ga_do","id":"b73131n301034","fields":{"ACTION":"start just past the right edge at a random height, with a random size and spin"},"next":{"block":{"type":"lo_show","id":"b3c103u0m5g6e","next":{"block":{"type":"fl_repeat_until","id":"b3w4o0l0o1h58","inputs":{"COND":{"block":{"type":"cd_words","id":"b634t003l4m4s","fields":{"TEXT":"I'm past the left edge"}}},"SUBSTACK":{"block":{"type":"ga_do","id":"b3h072434604h","fields":{"ACTION":"drift left at this wave's speed, spinning"}}}},"next":{"block":{"type":"co_delete_clone","id":"b6i6n0u331918"}}}}}}}},"x":24,"y":268}]}},"x":260,"y":0,"z":0,"size":100,"direction":0,"visible":true,"rotationStyle":"all around"}],"variables":[],"compiled":{"createdAt":1795151060399,"model":"openai/gpt-6.2-sol","mode":"2d","inputHash":"54eee2b8","summary":"","howToPlay":"","warnings":[],"code":[{"targetId":"t610e6g0q3n40","targetName":"Stage","className":"StageScript","source":"// The stage, compiled from its blocks.\nclass StageScript extends Stage {\n  start() {\n    this._script(\"_w697fc02036\", false, \"art style: [synthwave: deep purple space, a huge striped retro sun sinking into the horizon, a glowing pink and cyan grid racing toward it, bloom and a soft vignette on everything bright]\");\n    this._script(\"_wddc080d1c8\", false, \"rule: [every 15 seconds a new wave starts: asteroids come faster and more often, and a big glowing \\\"WAVE 2\\\" (3, 4...) banner sweeps across the screen with a whoosh]\");\n    this._script(\"_w1325ae4c1a\", false, \"rule: [at wave 4 the Mothership arrives from the right: a huge glowing saucer with a health bar at the top of the screen; it drifts up and down, fires slow pink energy orbs at the comet, and flashes white when the laser hits it]\");\n    this._script(\"_w6662bf9d29\", false, \"rule: [now and then a golden star drifts by; catching it sends out an expanding shockwave ring that blasts every asteroid on screen into confetti]\");\n    this._script(\"_w70ae5d5572\", false, \"rule: [the score is the seconds survived plus 50 for every asteroid blasted, shown big and glowing at the top center, with a combo multiplier that grows when you blast asteroids quickly one after another]\");\n    this._script(\"_we7416d361e\", false, \"rule: [a pulsing synthwave bass loop plays as music the whole game]\");\n  }\n  update(dt) {\n    if (this._w43b30c2476()) this.game.over();\n    if (this._w509930793a()) this.game.win();\n  }\n  // art style: [synthwave: deep purple space, a huge striped retro sun sinking into the horizon, a glowing pink and cyan grid racing toward it, bloom and a soft vignette on everything bright]\n  *_w697fc02036() {\n    const scene = this.game.scene;\n    const sky = scene.add.graphics().setDepth(-10).setScrollFactor(0);\n    sky.fillGradientStyle(0x100721, 0x100721, 0x391050, 0x391050).fillRect(0, 0, 480, 360);\n    for (let i = 0; i < 95; i++) {\n      sky.fillStyle(i % 5 === 0 ? 0x56f6ff : 0xe6b5ff, 0.25 + (i % 4) * 0.15).fillCircle((i * 137) % 480, (i * 73) % 222, i % 5 === 0 ? 1.4 : 0.7);\n    }\n    for (let y = -96; y < 57; y += 2) {\n      const stripe = y < -22 ? 16 : 11;\n      if (y > -52 && (y + 99) % stripe >= stripe - (y > 16 ? 5 : 3)) continue;\n      const w = Math.sqrt(98 * 98 - y * y);\n      const t = (y + 98) / 155;\n      sky.fillStyle(0xff0000 | (Math.round(218 - 171 * t) << 8) | Math.round(83 + 71 * t)).fillRect(240 - w, 164 + y, 2 * w, 2);\n    }\n    sky.fillGradientStyle(0x330d47, 0x330d47, 0x10051e, 0x10051e).fillRect(0, 220, 480, 140);\n    sky.lineStyle(3, 0xff42be, 0.65).lineBetween(0, 220, 480, 220);\n    for (let i = -9; i <= 9; i++) {\n      const color = i % 2 ? 0x24eaff : 0xff48cf;\n      sky.lineStyle(5, color, 0.10).lineBetween(240 + i * 5, 220, 240 + i * 57, 360);\n      sky.lineStyle(1, color, 0.66).lineBetween(240 + i * 5, 220, 240 + i * 57, 360);\n    }\n    const rows = Array.from({length: 14}, (_, i) => scene.add.rectangle(240, 220, 480, 2, i % 2 ? 0xff48cf : 0x24eaff).setDepth(-9).setScrollFactor(0));\n    this.game.camera.phaser.postFX?.addVignette?.(0.5, 0.5, 0.85, 0.24);\n    for (;;) {\n      rows.forEach((row, i) => {\n        const p = (i / rows.length + this.game.time * 0.7) % 1;\n        row.setPosition(240, 220 + 140 * p * p).setScale(1, 0.4 + p * 1.5).setAlpha(0.18 + p * 0.53);\n      });\n      yield;\n    }\n  }\n  // [the comet has no lives left]\n  _w43b30c2476() {\n    return (this.game.vars.lives ?? 3) <= 0;\n  }\n  // [the Mothership has been destroyed]\n  _w509930793a() {\n    return this.game.vars.mothershipDestroyed === true;\n  }\n  // rule: [every 15 seconds a new wave starts: asteroids come faster and more often, and a big glowing \"WAVE 2\" (3, 4...) banner sweeps across the screen with a whoosh]\n  *_wddc080d1c8() {\n    const g = this.game;\n    g.vars.wave = 1;\n    for (;;) {\n      const wave = 1 + Math.floor(g.time / 15);\n      if (wave !== g.vars.wave) {\n        g.vars.wave = wave;\n        this.playSound('wave whoosh');\n        const banner = g.scene.add.text(-180, 142, `WAVE ${wave}`, {fontFamily:'sans-serif', fontSize:'48px', fontStyle:'bold', color:'#fff1ff', stroke:'#a3189a', strokeThickness:6}).setOrigin(0.5).setScrollFactor(0).setDepth(100);\n        banner.setShadow(0, 0, '#ff4cce', 10, true, true);\n        this.run(function* () {\n          yield* this.tween(banner, {x:240}, 0.35, 'easeOut');\n          yield* this.wait(0.65);\n          yield* this.tween(banner, {x:660}, 0.35, 'easeIn');\n          banner.destroy();\n        });\n      }\n      yield;\n    }\n  }\n  // rule: [at wave 4 the Mothership arrives from the right: a huge glowing saucer with a health bar at the top of the screen; it drifts up and down, fires slow pink energy orbs at the comet, and flashes white when the laser hits it]\n  *_w1325ae4c1a() {\n    const g = this.game;\n    yield* this.waitUntil(() => (g.vars.wave ?? 1) >= 4);\n    const boss = g.spawn('Mothership', {x:335, y:0, visible:true});\n    yield* boss.glideTo({x:150,y:0}, 2, 'easeOut');\n    const bar = g.scene.add.graphics().setDepth(95).setScrollFactor(0);\n    g.ui.text('boss-label', 'MOTHERSHIP', {x:0,y:137,size:13,color:'#ff9be8',bold:true});\n    let fireAt = g.time + 0.65;\n    const arrived = g.time;\n    while (!g.vars.mothershipDestroyed) {\n      boss.y = 83 * Math.sin((g.time - arrived) * 1.7);\n      bar.clear().fillStyle(0x371148).fillRoundedRect(146, 55, 188, 10, 5);\n      bar.fillStyle(0xff49c6).fillRoundedRect(148, 57, Math.max(1, 184 * boss.hp / 14), 6, 3);\n      if (g.time >= fireAt) {\n        const comet = g.find('Comet');\n        if (comet) g.spawn('EnergyOrb', {x:boss.x - 52, y:boss.y, visible:true});\n        fireAt = g.time + 0.95;\n      }\n      yield;\n    }\n    bar.destroy();\n    g.ui.remove('boss-label');\n  }\n  // rule: [now and then a golden star drifts by; catching it sends out an expanding shockwave ring that blasts every asteroid on screen into confetti]\n  *_w6662bf9d29() {\n    const g = this.game;\n    for (;;) {\n      yield* this.wait(g.random(7, 12));\n      const star = g.spawn('GoldStar', {x:267, y:g.random(-121, 112), visible:true});\n      while (star.x > -267) {\n        star.x -= 93 * g.dt;\n        star.turn(85 * g.dt);\n        const comet = g.find('Comet');\n        if (comet && star.touching(comet)) {\n          comet.playSound('powerup');\n          const x = star.x, y = star.y;\n          const ring = g.scene.add.circle(x + 240, 180 - y, 10).setStrokeStyle(3, 0xffe073).setDepth(40);\n          this.run(function* () {\n            yield* this.tween(ring, {scaleX:60,scaleY:60,alpha:0}, 0.55, 'easeOut');\n            ring.destroy();\n          });\n          const view = g.camera.view();\n          for (const rock of g.findAll('Asteroid')) {\n            const r = 30 * rock.size / 100;\n            if (!rock.isClone || !rock.visible || rock.ndBlasted || rock.x + r < view.left || rock.x - r > view.right || rock.y + r < view.bottom || rock.y - r > view.top) continue;\n            rock.ndBlasted = true;\n            for (const color of ['#d359ff','#5bffff','#ffdb68']) g.effects.burst({x:rock.x,y:rock.y,color,count:5,speed:135,size:3,lifetime:0.45});\n            g.broadcast('nd-rock-blasted');\n            rock.destroy();\n          }\n          break;\n        }\n        yield;\n      }\n      star.destroy();\n    }\n  }\n  // rule: [the score is the seconds survived plus 50 for every asteroid blasted, shown big and glowing at the top center, with a combo multiplier that grows when you blast asteroids quickly one after another]\n  *_w70ae5d5572() {\n    const g = this.game;\n    let points = 0, combo = 0, last = -100, shown = '';\n    g.vars.score = 0;\n    g.on('nd-rock-blasted', () => {\n      combo = g.time - last <= 2 ? Math.min(6, combo + 1) : 1;\n      last = g.time;\n      points += 50 * combo;\n    });\n    const hud = g.scene.add.text(240, 19, '', {fontFamily:'sans-serif',fontSize:'23px',fontStyle:'bold',color:'#d5ffff',stroke:'#4f176a',strokeThickness:4}).setOrigin(0.5).setDepth(90).setScrollFactor(0);\n    hud.setShadow(0, 0, '#3cefff', 7, true, true);\n    for (;;) {\n      g.vars.score = Math.floor(g.time) + points;\n      const label = `SCORE ${g.vars.score}${combo > 1 && g.time - last <= 2 ? `  ×${combo}` : ''}`;\n      if (label !== shown) { shown = label; hud.setText(label); }\n      yield;\n    }\n  }\n  // rule: [a pulsing synthwave bass loop plays as music the whole game]\n  *_we7416d361e() {\n    this.game.music('neon bass');\n  }\n}","runSource":"// The stage, compiled from its blocks.\nclass StageScript extends Stage {\n  start() {\n    this._script(\"_w697fc02036\", false, \"art style: [synthwave: deep purple space, a huge striped retro sun sinking into the horizon, a glowing pink and cyan grid racing toward it, bloom and a soft vignette on everything bright]\");\n    this._script(\"_wddc080d1c8\", false, \"rule: [every 15 seconds a new wave starts: asteroids come faster and more often, and a big glowing \\\"WAVE 2\\\" (3, 4...) banner sweeps across the screen with a whoosh]\");\n    this._script(\"_w1325ae4c1a\", false, \"rule: [at wave 4 the Mothership arrives from the right: a huge glowing saucer with a health bar at the top of the screen; it drifts up and down, fires slow pink energy orbs at the comet, and flashes white when the laser hits it]\");\n    this._script(\"_w6662bf9d29\", false, \"rule: [now and then a golden star drifts by; catching it sends out an expanding shockwave ring that blasts every asteroid on screen into confetti]\");\n    this._script(\"_w70ae5d5572\", false, \"rule: [the score is the seconds survived plus 50 for every asteroid blasted, shown big and glowing at the top center, with a combo multiplier that grows when you blast asteroids quickly one after another]\");\n    this._script(\"_we7416d361e\", false, \"rule: [a pulsing synthwave bass loop plays as music the whole game]\");\n  }\n  update(dt) {\n    if (this._w43b30c2476()) this.game.over();\n    if (this._w509930793a()) this.game.win();\n  }\n  // art style: [synthwave: deep purple space, a huge striped retro sun sinking into the horizon, a glowing pink and cyan grid racing toward it, bloom and a soft vignette on everything bright]\n  *_w697fc02036() {\n    const scene = this.game.scene;\n    const sky = scene.add.graphics().setDepth(-10).setScrollFactor(0);\n    sky.fillGradientStyle(0x100721, 0x100721, 0x391050, 0x391050).fillRect(0, 0, 480, 360);\n    for (let i = 0; i < 95; i++) { if (__ambleGuardYield()) yield; \n      sky.fillStyle(i % 5 === 0 ? 0x56f6ff : 0xe6b5ff, 0.25 + (i % 4) * 0.15).fillCircle((i * 137) % 480, (i * 73) % 222, i % 5 === 0 ? 1.4 : 0.7);\n    }\n    for (let y = -96; y < 57; y += 2) { if (__ambleGuardYield()) yield; \n      const stripe = y < -22 ? 16 : 11;\n      if (y > -52 && (y + 99) % stripe >= stripe - (y > 16 ? 5 : 3)) continue;\n      const w = Math.sqrt(98 * 98 - y * y);\n      const t = (y + 98) / 155;\n      sky.fillStyle(0xff0000 | (Math.round(218 - 171 * t) << 8) | Math.round(83 + 71 * t)).fillRect(240 - w, 164 + y, 2 * w, 2);\n    }\n    sky.fillGradientStyle(0x330d47, 0x330d47, 0x10051e, 0x10051e).fillRect(0, 220, 480, 140);\n    sky.lineStyle(3, 0xff42be, 0.65).lineBetween(0, 220, 480, 220);\n    for (let i = -9; i <= 9; i++) { if (__ambleGuardYield()) yield; \n      const color = i % 2 ? 0x24eaff : 0xff48cf;\n      sky.lineStyle(5, color, 0.10).lineBetween(240 + i * 5, 220, 240 + i * 57, 360);\n      sky.lineStyle(1, color, 0.66).lineBetween(240 + i * 5, 220, 240 + i * 57, 360);\n    }\n    const rows = Array.from({length: 14}, (_, i) => scene.add.rectangle(240, 220, 480, 2, i % 2 ? 0xff48cf : 0x24eaff).setDepth(-9).setScrollFactor(0));\n    this.game.camera.phaser.postFX?.addVignette?.(0.5, 0.5, 0.85, 0.24);\n    for (;;) { if (__ambleGuardYield()) yield; \n      rows.forEach((row, i) => {\n        const p = (i / rows.length + this.game.time * 0.7) % 1;\n        row.setPosition(240, 220 + 140 * p * p).setScale(1, 0.4 + p * 1.5).setAlpha(0.18 + p * 0.53);\n      });\n      yield;\n    }\n  }\n  // [the comet has no lives left]\n  _w43b30c2476() {\n    return (this.game.vars.lives ?? 3) <= 0;\n  }\n  // [the Mothership has been destroyed]\n  _w509930793a() {\n    return this.game.vars.mothershipDestroyed === true;\n  }\n  // rule: [every 15 seconds a new wave starts: asteroids come faster and more often, and a big glowing \"WAVE 2\" (3, 4...) banner sweeps across the screen with a whoosh]\n  *_wddc080d1c8() {\n    const g = this.game;\n    g.vars.wave = 1;\n    for (;;) { if (__ambleGuardYield()) yield; \n      const wave = 1 + Math.floor(g.time / 15);\n      if (wave !== g.vars.wave) {\n        g.vars.wave = wave;\n        this.playSound('wave whoosh');\n        const banner = g.scene.add.text(-180, 142, `WAVE ${wave}`, {fontFamily:'sans-serif', fontSize:'48px', fontStyle:'bold', color:'#fff1ff', stroke:'#a3189a', strokeThickness:6}).setOrigin(0.5).setScrollFactor(0).setDepth(100);\n        banner.setShadow(0, 0, '#ff4cce', 10, true, true);\n        this.run(function* () {\n          yield* this.tween(banner, {x:240}, 0.35, 'easeOut');\n          yield* this.wait(0.65);\n          yield* this.tween(banner, {x:660}, 0.35, 'easeIn');\n          banner.destroy();\n        });\n      }\n      yield;\n    }\n  }\n  // rule: [at wave 4 the Mothership arrives from the right: a huge glowing saucer with a health bar at the top of the screen; it drifts up and down, fires slow pink energy orbs at the comet, and flashes white when the laser hits it]\n  *_w1325ae4c1a() {\n    const g = this.game;\n    yield* this.waitUntil(() => (g.vars.wave ?? 1) >= 4);\n    const boss = g.spawn('Mothership', {x:335, y:0, visible:true});\n    yield* boss.glideTo({x:150,y:0}, 2, 'easeOut');\n    const bar = g.scene.add.graphics().setDepth(95).setScrollFactor(0);\n    g.ui.text('boss-label', 'MOTHERSHIP', {x:0,y:137,size:13,color:'#ff9be8',bold:true});\n    let fireAt = g.time + 0.65;\n    const arrived = g.time;\n    while (!g.vars.mothershipDestroyed) { if (__ambleGuardYield()) yield; \n      boss.y = 83 * Math.sin((g.time - arrived) * 1.7);\n      bar.clear().fillStyle(0x371148).fillRoundedRect(146, 55, 188, 10, 5);\n      bar.fillStyle(0xff49c6).fillRoundedRect(148, 57, Math.max(1, 184 * boss.hp / 14), 6, 3);\n      if (g.time >= fireAt) {\n        const comet = g.find('Comet');\n        if (comet) g.spawn('EnergyOrb', {x:boss.x - 52, y:boss.y, visible:true});\n        fireAt = g.time + 0.95;\n      }\n      yield;\n    }\n    bar.destroy();\n    g.ui.remove('boss-label');\n  }\n  // rule: [now and then a golden star drifts by; catching it sends out an expanding shockwave ring that blasts every asteroid on screen into confetti]\n  *_w6662bf9d29() {\n    const g = this.game;\n    for (;;) { if (__ambleGuardYield()) yield; \n      yield* this.wait(g.random(7, 12));\n      const star = g.spawn('GoldStar', {x:267, y:g.random(-121, 112), visible:true});\n      while (star.x > -267) { if (__ambleGuardYield()) yield; \n        star.x -= 93 * g.dt;\n        star.turn(85 * g.dt);\n        const comet = g.find('Comet');\n        if (comet && star.touching(comet)) {\n          comet.playSound('powerup');\n          const x = star.x, y = star.y;\n          const ring = g.scene.add.circle(x + 240, 180 - y, 10).setStrokeStyle(3, 0xffe073).setDepth(40);\n          this.run(function* () {\n            yield* this.tween(ring, {scaleX:60,scaleY:60,alpha:0}, 0.55, 'easeOut');\n            ring.destroy();\n          });\n          const view = g.camera.view();\n          for (const rock of g.findAll('Asteroid')) { if (__ambleGuardYield()) yield; \n            const r = 30 * rock.size / 100;\n            if (!rock.isClone || !rock.visible || rock.ndBlasted || rock.x + r < view.left || rock.x - r > view.right || rock.y + r < view.bottom || rock.y - r > view.top) continue;\n            rock.ndBlasted = true;\n            for (const color of ['#d359ff','#5bffff','#ffdb68']) { if (__ambleGuardYield()) yield; g.effects.burst({x:rock.x,y:rock.y,color,count:5,speed:135,size:3,lifetime:0.45}); }\n            g.broadcast('nd-rock-blasted');\n            rock.destroy();\n          }\n          break;\n        }\n        yield;\n      }\n      star.destroy();\n    }\n  }\n  // rule: [the score is the seconds survived plus 50 for every asteroid blasted, shown big and glowing at the top center, with a combo multiplier that grows when you blast asteroids quickly one after another]\n  *_w70ae5d5572() {\n    const g = this.game;\n    let points = 0, combo = 0, last = -100, shown = '';\n    g.vars.score = 0;\n    g.on('nd-rock-blasted', () => {\n      combo = g.time - last <= 2 ? Math.min(6, combo + 1) : 1;\n      last = g.time;\n      points += 50 * combo;\n    });\n    const hud = g.scene.add.text(240, 19, '', {fontFamily:'sans-serif',fontSize:'23px',fontStyle:'bold',color:'#d5ffff',stroke:'#4f176a',strokeThickness:4}).setOrigin(0.5).setDepth(90).setScrollFactor(0);\n    hud.setShadow(0, 0, '#3cefff', 7, true, true);\n    for (;;) { if (__ambleGuardYield()) yield; \n      g.vars.score = Math.floor(g.time) + points;\n      const label = `SCORE ${g.vars.score}${combo > 1 && g.time - last <= 2 ? `  ×${combo}` : ''}`;\n      if (label !== shown) { shown = label; hud.setText(label); }\n      yield;\n    }\n  }\n  // rule: [a pulsing synthwave bass loop plays as music the whole game]\n  *_we7416d361e() {\n    this.game.music('neon bass');\n  }\n}"},{"targetId":"t253i5t3w3c2s","targetName":"Comet","className":"Comet","source":"// Comet, compiled from its blocks.\nclass Comet extends Sprite {\n  start() {\n    this._script(\"_weff8919a44\", false, \"always: [glide smoothly toward the mouse, tilting the way I move, with a long glowing cyan trail of sparkles behind me]\");\n    this._script(\"_w4ad4138e36\", false, \"rule: [the comet has 3 lives, shown as little glowing hearts at the top right]\");\n    this._script(\"_wa87452cc42\", false, \"never: [leave the screen]\");\n  }\n  onSpawn() {\n    this._script(\"_weff8919a44\", false, \"always: [glide smoothly toward the mouse, tilting the way I move, with a long glowing cyan trail of sparkles behind me]\");\n    this._script(\"_wa87452cc42\", false, \"never: [leave the screen]\");\n  }\n  onKeyDown(key) {\n    if (key === \"space\") this._script(\"_s1\", false, \"when [space ▾] key pressed\");\n  }\n  onClick() {\n    this._script(\"_s2\", true, \"when I'm clicked\");\n  }\n  update(dt) {\n    { const now = !!this.touching(\"Asteroid\"); if (now && !this._e1) this._script(\"_s3\", false, \"when I touch (Asteroid)\"); this._e1 = now; }\n  }\n  // when [space ▾] key pressed\n  *_s1() {\n    this.playSound(\"laser\");\n    yield* this._w50cb85e2ec();\n  }\n  // when I'm clicked\n  *_s2() {\n    yield* this._w50cb85e2ec();\n  }\n  // when I touch (Asteroid)\n  *_s3() {\n    if (this._w5f1e348094()) {\n      this.playSound(\"hit\");\n      this.game.camera.shake(8, 0.3);\n      yield* this._wa48bfe633b();\n      yield* this._w9faed7583a();\n    }\n  }\n  // always: [glide smoothly toward the mouse, tilting the way I move, with a long glowing cyan trail of sparkles behind me]\n  *_weff8919a44() {\n    const g = this.game;\n    const trail = g.scene.add.particles(0, 0, 'amble-dot', {frequency:-1, speed:{min:12,max:55}, lifespan:{min:300,max:680}, scale:{start:0.65,end:0}, alpha:{start:0.75,end:0}, tint:[0x49f9ff,0x1daaff,0xb8ffff], blendMode:'ADD'}).setDepth(-1);\n    let tick = 0;\n    for (;;) {\n      const m = g.input.mouse;\n      const dx = Math.max(-209, Math.min(209, m.x)) - this.x;\n      const dy = Math.max(-149, Math.min(149, m.y)) - this.y;\n      const d = Math.hypot(dx, dy);\n      if (d > 0.5) {\n        const step = Math.min(d * (1 - Math.exp(-9 * g.dt)), 380 * g.dt);\n        this.setPosition(this.x + dx / d * step, this.y + dy / d * step);\n        const target = Math.atan2(dy, dx) * 180 / Math.PI;\n        const delta = ((target - this.angle + 540) % 360) - 180;\n        this.angle += delta * 0.22;\n      }\n      if (++tick % 2 === 0) {\n        const a = this.angle * Math.PI / 180;\n        trail.emitParticleAt(this.x + 240 - 21 * Math.cos(a), 180 - this.y + 21 * Math.sin(a), d > 4 ? 3 : 1);\n      }\n      yield;\n    }\n  }\n  // rule: [the comet has 3 lives, shown as little glowing hearts at the top right]\n  *_w4ad4138e36() {\n    const g = this.game;\n    g.vars.lives ??= 3;\n    const hearts = g.scene.add.text(465, 19, '', {fontFamily:'sans-serif',fontSize:'22px',color:'#ff81c9',stroke:'#63104f',strokeThickness:3}).setOrigin(1, 0.5).setDepth(90).setScrollFactor(0);\n    hearts.setShadow(0, 0, '#ff57b9', 8, true, true);\n    let previous = -1;\n    for (;;) {\n      if (previous !== g.vars.lives) {\n        previous = g.vars.lives;\n        const n = Math.max(0, Math.min(3, previous));\n        hearts.setText('♥'.repeat(n) + '♡'.repeat(3 - n));\n      }\n      yield;\n    }\n  }\n  // never: [leave the screen]\n  *_wa87452cc42() {\n    for (;;) {\n      const v = this.game.camera.view();\n      const r = 38 * this.size / 100;\n      this.setPosition(Math.max(v.left + r, Math.min(v.right - r, this.x)), Math.max(v.bottom + r, Math.min(v.top - r, this.y)));\n      yield;\n    }\n  }\n  // do [fire a bright cyan laser bolt straight ahead that shatters the first asteroid it hits into glowing purple rubble]\n  *_w50cb85e2ec() {\n    const g = this.game;\n    this.ndNextShot ??= 0;\n    if (g.time < this.ndNextShot) return;\n    this.ndNextShot = g.time + 0.15;\n    const a = this.angle * Math.PI / 180;\n    this.shoot('LaserBolt', {at:this.angle, speed:680, range:590, from:{x:this.x + 21 * Math.cos(a), y:this.y + 21 * Math.sin(a)}, hits:['Asteroid','Mothership'], onHit:(target) => {\n      if (!target.isClone || !target.visible) return false;\n      if (target.name === 'Mothership') {\n        if (!target.ndReady || target.hp <= 0) return false;\n        target.takeLaser();\n        return;\n      }\n      if (target.ndBlasted) return false;\n      target.ndBlasted = true;\n      g.effects.burst({x:target.x,y:target.y,color:'#c767ff',count:16,speed:140,size:4,lifetime:0.4});\n      g.broadcast('nd-rock-blasted');\n      target.destroy();\n    }});\n  }\n  // [I'm not blinking]\n  _w5f1e348094() {\n    return this.game.time >= (this.ndBlinkUntil ?? 0) && (this.game.vars.lives ?? 3) > 0;\n  }\n  // particles: [a burst of hot pink sparks]\n  *_wa48bfe633b() {\n    this.game.effects.burst({x:this.x,y:this.y,color:'#ff37ae',count:20,speed:155,size:3,lifetime:0.38});\n  }\n  // do [lose a life, then blink for 1 second (asteroids can't hurt me while I blink)]\n  *_w9faed7583a() {\n    const g = this.game;\n    if (g.time < (this.ndBlinkUntil ?? 0) || (g.vars.lives ?? 3) <= 0) return;\n    this.ndBlinkUntil = g.time + 1;\n    g.vars.lives = Math.max(0, (g.vars.lives ?? 3) - 1);\n    while (g.time < this.ndBlinkUntil) {\n      this.opacity = Math.floor((this.ndBlinkUntil - g.time) * 12) % 2 ? 0.24 : 1;\n      yield;\n    }\n    this.opacity = 1;\n  }\n}","runSource":"// Comet, compiled from its blocks.\nclass Comet extends Sprite {\n  start() {\n    this._script(\"_weff8919a44\", false, \"always: [glide smoothly toward the mouse, tilting the way I move, with a long glowing cyan trail of sparkles behind me]\");\n    this._script(\"_w4ad4138e36\", false, \"rule: [the comet has 3 lives, shown as little glowing hearts at the top right]\");\n    this._script(\"_wa87452cc42\", false, \"never: [leave the screen]\");\n  }\n  onSpawn() {\n    this._script(\"_weff8919a44\", false, \"always: [glide smoothly toward the mouse, tilting the way I move, with a long glowing cyan trail of sparkles behind me]\");\n    this._script(\"_wa87452cc42\", false, \"never: [leave the screen]\");\n  }\n  onKeyDown(key) {\n    if (key === \"space\") this._script(\"_s1\", false, \"when [space ▾] key pressed\");\n  }\n  onClick() {\n    this._script(\"_s2\", true, \"when I'm clicked\");\n  }\n  update(dt) {\n    { const now = !!this.touching(\"Asteroid\"); if (now && !this._e1) this._script(\"_s3\", false, \"when I touch (Asteroid)\"); this._e1 = now; }\n  }\n  // when [space ▾] key pressed\n  *_s1() {\n    this.playSound(\"laser\");\n    yield* this._w50cb85e2ec();\n  }\n  // when I'm clicked\n  *_s2() {\n    yield* this._w50cb85e2ec();\n  }\n  // when I touch (Asteroid)\n  *_s3() {\n    if (this._w5f1e348094()) {\n      this.playSound(\"hit\");\n      this.game.camera.shake(8, 0.3);\n      yield* this._wa48bfe633b();\n      yield* this._w9faed7583a();\n    }\n  }\n  // always: [glide smoothly toward the mouse, tilting the way I move, with a long glowing cyan trail of sparkles behind me]\n  *_weff8919a44() {\n    const g = this.game;\n    const trail = g.scene.add.particles(0, 0, 'amble-dot', {frequency:-1, speed:{min:12,max:55}, lifespan:{min:300,max:680}, scale:{start:0.65,end:0}, alpha:{start:0.75,end:0}, tint:[0x49f9ff,0x1daaff,0xb8ffff], blendMode:'ADD'}).setDepth(-1);\n    let tick = 0;\n    for (;;) { if (__ambleGuardYield()) yield; \n      const m = g.input.mouse;\n      const dx = Math.max(-209, Math.min(209, m.x)) - this.x;\n      const dy = Math.max(-149, Math.min(149, m.y)) - this.y;\n      const d = Math.hypot(dx, dy);\n      if (d > 0.5) {\n        const step = Math.min(d * (1 - Math.exp(-9 * g.dt)), 380 * g.dt);\n        this.setPosition(this.x + dx / d * step, this.y + dy / d * step);\n        const target = Math.atan2(dy, dx) * 180 / Math.PI;\n        const delta = ((target - this.angle + 540) % 360) - 180;\n        this.angle += delta * 0.22;\n      }\n      if (++tick % 2 === 0) {\n        const a = this.angle * Math.PI / 180;\n        trail.emitParticleAt(this.x + 240 - 21 * Math.cos(a), 180 - this.y + 21 * Math.sin(a), d > 4 ? 3 : 1);\n      }\n      yield;\n    }\n  }\n  // rule: [the comet has 3 lives, shown as little glowing hearts at the top right]\n  *_w4ad4138e36() {\n    const g = this.game;\n    g.vars.lives ??= 3;\n    const hearts = g.scene.add.text(465, 19, '', {fontFamily:'sans-serif',fontSize:'22px',color:'#ff81c9',stroke:'#63104f',strokeThickness:3}).setOrigin(1, 0.5).setDepth(90).setScrollFactor(0);\n    hearts.setShadow(0, 0, '#ff57b9', 8, true, true);\n    let previous = -1;\n    for (;;) { if (__ambleGuardYield()) yield; \n      if (previous !== g.vars.lives) {\n        previous = g.vars.lives;\n        const n = Math.max(0, Math.min(3, previous));\n        hearts.setText('♥'.repeat(n) + '♡'.repeat(3 - n));\n      }\n      yield;\n    }\n  }\n  // never: [leave the screen]\n  *_wa87452cc42() {\n    for (;;) { if (__ambleGuardYield()) yield; \n      const v = this.game.camera.view();\n      const r = 38 * this.size / 100;\n      this.setPosition(Math.max(v.left + r, Math.min(v.right - r, this.x)), Math.max(v.bottom + r, Math.min(v.top - r, this.y)));\n      yield;\n    }\n  }\n  // do [fire a bright cyan laser bolt straight ahead that shatters the first asteroid it hits into glowing purple rubble]\n  *_w50cb85e2ec() {\n    const g = this.game;\n    this.ndNextShot ??= 0;\n    if (g.time < this.ndNextShot) return;\n    this.ndNextShot = g.time + 0.15;\n    const a = this.angle * Math.PI / 180;\n    this.shoot('LaserBolt', {at:this.angle, speed:680, range:590, from:{x:this.x + 21 * Math.cos(a), y:this.y + 21 * Math.sin(a)}, hits:['Asteroid','Mothership'], onHit:(target) => {\n      if (!target.isClone || !target.visible) return false;\n      if (target.name === 'Mothership') {\n        if (!target.ndReady || target.hp <= 0) return false;\n        target.takeLaser();\n        return;\n      }\n      if (target.ndBlasted) return false;\n      target.ndBlasted = true;\n      g.effects.burst({x:target.x,y:target.y,color:'#c767ff',count:16,speed:140,size:4,lifetime:0.4});\n      g.broadcast('nd-rock-blasted');\n      target.destroy();\n    }});\n  }\n  // [I'm not blinking]\n  _w5f1e348094() {\n    return this.game.time >= (this.ndBlinkUntil ?? 0) && (this.game.vars.lives ?? 3) > 0;\n  }\n  // particles: [a burst of hot pink sparks]\n  *_wa48bfe633b() {\n    this.game.effects.burst({x:this.x,y:this.y,color:'#ff37ae',count:20,speed:155,size:3,lifetime:0.38});\n  }\n  // do [lose a life, then blink for 1 second (asteroids can't hurt me while I blink)]\n  *_w9faed7583a() {\n    const g = this.game;\n    if (g.time < (this.ndBlinkUntil ?? 0) || (g.vars.lives ?? 3) <= 0) return;\n    this.ndBlinkUntil = g.time + 1;\n    g.vars.lives = Math.max(0, (g.vars.lives ?? 3) - 1);\n    while (g.time < this.ndBlinkUntil) { if (__ambleGuardYield()) yield; \n      this.opacity = Math.floor((this.ndBlinkUntil - g.time) * 12) % 2 ? 0.24 : 1;\n      yield;\n    }\n    this.opacity = 1;\n  }\n}"},{"targetId":"t1k3a0f1k4a65","targetName":"Asteroid","className":"Asteroid","source":"// Asteroid, compiled from its blocks.\nclass Asteroid extends Sprite {\n  start() {\n    this._script(\"_s1\", true, \"when ⚑ clicked\");\n  }\n  onSpawn() {\n    this._script(\"_s2\", false, \"when I'm created as a copy\");\n  }\n  // when ⚑ clicked\n  *_s1() {\n    this.hide();\n    for (;;) {\n      this.clone();\n      yield* this.wait((Number(this._w20f2bfbd50()) || 0));\n      yield;\n    }\n  }\n  // when I'm created as a copy\n  *_s2() {\n    yield* this._wf3cdb5855f();\n    this.show();\n    while (!(this._w5db7e1d1f6())) {\n      yield* this._wb88fd29394();\n      yield;\n    }\n    if (this.isClone) { this.destroy(); return; }\n  }\n  // [a little less time each wave, starting at 1 second]\n  _w20f2bfbd50() {\n    return Math.max(0.32, 1 / (1 + 0.23 * ((this.game.vars.wave ?? 1) - 1)));\n  }\n  // do [start just past the right edge at a random height, with a random size and spin]\n  *_wf3cdb5855f() {\n    const g = this.game;\n    this.size = g.random(57, 113);\n    this.setPosition(g.camera.view().right + 36, g.random(-138, 138));\n    this.angle = g.random(0, 359);\n    this.ndSpin = g.random(35, 125) * (g.random(0, 1) ? 1 : -1);\n    this.ndBlasted = false;\n  }\n  // [I'm past the left edge]\n  _w5db7e1d1f6() {\n    return this.x < this.game.camera.view().left - 38;\n  }\n  // do [drift left at this wave's speed, spinning]\n  *_wb88fd29394() {\n    const g = this.game;\n    this.x -= Math.min(245, 105 + 29 * ((g.vars.wave ?? 1) - 1)) * g.dt;\n    this.turn((this.ndSpin ?? 75) * g.dt);\n  }\n}","runSource":"// Asteroid, compiled from its blocks.\nclass Asteroid extends Sprite {\n  start() {\n    this._script(\"_s1\", true, \"when ⚑ clicked\");\n  }\n  onSpawn() {\n    this._script(\"_s2\", false, \"when I'm created as a copy\");\n  }\n  // when ⚑ clicked\n  *_s1() {\n    this.hide();\n    for (;;) { if (__ambleGuardYield()) yield; \n      this.clone();\n      yield* this.wait((Number(this._w20f2bfbd50()) || 0));\n      yield;\n    }\n  }\n  // when I'm created as a copy\n  *_s2() {\n    yield* this._wf3cdb5855f();\n    this.show();\n    while (!(this._w5db7e1d1f6())) { if (__ambleGuardYield()) yield; \n      yield* this._wb88fd29394();\n      yield;\n    }\n    if (this.isClone) { this.destroy(); return; }\n  }\n  // [a little less time each wave, starting at 1 second]\n  _w20f2bfbd50() {\n    return Math.max(0.32, 1 / (1 + 0.23 * ((this.game.vars.wave ?? 1) - 1)));\n  }\n  // do [start just past the right edge at a random height, with a random size and spin]\n  *_wf3cdb5855f() {\n    const g = this.game;\n    this.size = g.random(57, 113);\n    this.setPosition(g.camera.view().right + 36, g.random(-138, 138));\n    this.angle = g.random(0, 359);\n    this.ndSpin = g.random(35, 125) * (g.random(0, 1) ? 1 : -1);\n    this.ndBlasted = false;\n  }\n  // [I'm past the left edge]\n  _w5db7e1d1f6() {\n    return this.x < this.game.camera.view().left - 38;\n  }\n  // do [drift left at this wave's speed, spinning]\n  *_wb88fd29394() {\n    const g = this.game;\n    this.x -= Math.min(245, 105 + 29 * ((g.vars.wave ?? 1) - 1)) * g.dt;\n    this.turn((this.ndSpin ?? 75) * g.dt);\n  }\n}"},{"targetId":"s0v0x10215n51","targetName":"Mothership","className":"Mothership","source":"class Mothership extends Sprite {\n  start() { this.hide(); }\n  onSpawn() {\n    this.rotationStyle = 'don\\u0027t rotate';\n    this.hp = 14;\n    this.ndReady = true;\n    this.ndFlashUntil = 0;\n    this.image.postFX?.addGlow?.(0xff53d2, 3);\n  }\n  takeLaser() {\n    if (this.hp <= 0) return;\n    this.hp--;\n    this.ndFlashUntil = this.game.time + 0.11;\n    this.image.setTintFill(0xffffff);\n    this.game.effects.burst({x:this.x-35,y:this.y,color:'#ff8be8',count:9,speed:100,size:3,lifetime:0.25});\n    if (!this.hp) {\n      this.game.effects.burst({x:this.x,y:this.y,color:'#ff68da',count:45,speed:220,size:6,lifetime:0.7});\n      this.hide();\n      this.game.camera.shake(7, 0.25);\n      this.after(0.55, () => { this.game.vars.mothershipDestroyed = true; this.destroy(); });\n    }\n  }\n  update() {\n    if (this.isClone && this.ndFlashUntil && this.game.time >= this.ndFlashUntil) { this.ndFlashUntil = 0; this.image.clearTint(); }\n  }\n}","runSource":"class Mothership extends Sprite {\n  start() { this.hide(); }\n  onSpawn() {\n    this.rotationStyle = 'don\\u0027t rotate';\n    this.hp = 14;\n    this.ndReady = true;\n    this.ndFlashUntil = 0;\n    this.image.postFX?.addGlow?.(0xff53d2, 3);\n  }\n  takeLaser() {\n    if (this.hp <= 0) return;\n    this.hp--;\n    this.ndFlashUntil = this.game.time + 0.11;\n    this.image.setTintFill(0xffffff);\n    this.game.effects.burst({x:this.x-35,y:this.y,color:'#ff8be8',count:9,speed:100,size:3,lifetime:0.25});\n    if (!this.hp) {\n      this.game.effects.burst({x:this.x,y:this.y,color:'#ff68da',count:45,speed:220,size:6,lifetime:0.7});\n      this.hide();\n      this.game.camera.shake(7, 0.25);\n      this.after(0.55, () => { this.game.vars.mothershipDestroyed = true; this.destroy(); });\n    }\n  }\n  update() {\n    if (this.isClone && this.ndFlashUntil && this.game.time >= this.ndFlashUntil) { this.ndFlashUntil = 0; this.image.clearTint(); }\n  }\n}"},{"targetId":"s023s2r3d2112","targetName":"EnergyOrb","className":"EnergyOrb","source":"class EnergyOrb extends Sprite {\n  start() { this.hide(); }\n  onSpawn() {\n    const p = this.game.find('Comet');\n    const a = p ? Math.atan2(p.y - this.y, p.x - this.x) : Math.PI;\n    this.velocity = {x:116 * Math.cos(a), y:116 * Math.sin(a)};\n    this.expires = this.game.time + 6;\n  }\n  update() {\n    if (!this.isClone) return;\n    if (this.game.time >= this.expires || this.x < -267 || this.x > 380 || Math.abs(this.y) > 208) { this.destroy(); return; }\n    const p = this.touching('Comet');\n    if (!p) return;\n    const g = this.game;\n    if (g.time >= (p.ndBlinkUntil ?? 0) && (g.vars.lives ?? 3) > 0) {\n      p.playSound('hit');\n      g.camera.shake(4, 0.2);\n      g.effects.burst({x:p.x,y:p.y,color:'#ff37ae',count:20,speed:155,size:3,lifetime:0.38});\n      p.ndBlinkUntil = g.time + 1;\n      g.vars.lives = Math.max(0, (g.vars.lives ?? 3) - 1);\n      p.run(function* () {\n        while (g.time < this.ndBlinkUntil) {\n          this.opacity = Math.floor((this.ndBlinkUntil - g.time) * 12) % 2 ? 0.24 : 1;\n          yield;\n        }\n        this.opacity = 1;\n      });\n    }\n    this.destroy();\n  }\n}","runSource":"class EnergyOrb extends Sprite {\n  start() { this.hide(); }\n  onSpawn() {\n    const p = this.game.find('Comet');\n    const a = p ? Math.atan2(p.y - this.y, p.x - this.x) : Math.PI;\n    this.velocity = {x:116 * Math.cos(a), y:116 * Math.sin(a)};\n    this.expires = this.game.time + 6;\n  }\n  update() {\n    if (!this.isClone) return;\n    if (this.game.time >= this.expires || this.x < -267 || this.x > 380 || Math.abs(this.y) > 208) { this.destroy(); return; }\n    const p = this.touching('Comet');\n    if (!p) return;\n    const g = this.game;\n    if (g.time >= (p.ndBlinkUntil ?? 0) && (g.vars.lives ?? 3) > 0) {\n      p.playSound('hit');\n      g.camera.shake(4, 0.2);\n      g.effects.burst({x:p.x,y:p.y,color:'#ff37ae',count:20,speed:155,size:3,lifetime:0.38});\n      p.ndBlinkUntil = g.time + 1;\n      g.vars.lives = Math.max(0, (g.vars.lives ?? 3) - 1);\n      p.run(function* () {\n        while (g.time < this.ndBlinkUntil) { if (__ambleGuardYield()) yield; \n          this.opacity = Math.floor((this.ndBlinkUntil - g.time) * 12) % 2 ? 0.24 : 1;\n          yield;\n        }\n        this.opacity = 1;\n      });\n    }\n    this.destroy();\n  }\n}"},{"targetId":"s3f421x2l0917","targetName":"GoldStar","className":"GoldStar","source":"class GoldStar extends Sprite {\n  start() { this.hide(); }\n  onSpawn() { this.image.postFX?.addGlow?.(0xffca45, 4); }\n}","runSource":"class GoldStar extends Sprite {\n  start() { this.hide(); }\n  onSpawn() { this.image.postFX?.addGlow?.(0xffca45, 4); }\n}"},{"targetId":"s6i5i0q6q3b5x","targetName":"LaserBolt","className":"LaserBolt","source":"class LaserBolt extends Sprite {\n  start() { this.hide(); }\n}","runSource":"class LaserBolt extends Sprite {\n  start() { this.hide(); }\n}"}],"sprites":[{"id":"s0v0x10215n51","name":"Mothership","description":"A huge neon saucer that swoops in on wave four and fires pink energy orbs.","x":335,"y":0,"size":100,"direction":180,"visible":false,"rotationStyle":"all around"},{"id":"s023s2r3d2112","name":"EnergyOrb","description":"A slow pink orb aimed at where the comet was when the Mothership fired.","x":0,"y":0,"size":100,"direction":0,"visible":false,"rotationStyle":"all around"},{"id":"s3f421x2l0917","name":"GoldStar","description":"A golden pickup that clears the screen of asteroids.","x":0,"y":0,"size":100,"direction":0,"visible":false,"rotationStyle":"all around"},{"id":"s6i5i0q6q3b5x","name":"LaserBolt","description":"A fast cyan bolt fired in the direction the comet faces.","x":0,"y":0,"size":100,"direction":0,"visible":false,"rotationStyle":"all around"}],"assets":[{"id":"a5m5129680h29","kind":"image","name":"saucer","dataUrl":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","mime":"image/svg+xml","width":142,"height":72,"resolution":1,"centerX":71,"centerY":36,"description":"A broad retro flying saucer, transparent background, dark violet hull with layered elliptical bands, a hot pink neon rim, an electric cyan glass dome, and four magenta lamps underneath. Bold arcade silhouette and luminous edges.","targetId":"s0v0x10215n51","targetName":"Mothership","request":"A broad retro flying saucer, transparent background, dark violet hull with layered elliptical bands, a hot pink neon rim, an electric cyan glass dome, and four magenta lamps underneath. Bold arcade silhouette and luminous edges."},{"id":"a1y4h1v4d6n50","kind":"image","name":"pink orb","dataUrl":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","mime":"image/svg+xml","width":24,"height":24,"resolution":1,"centerX":12,"centerY":12,"description":"A round hot pink plasma orb with a white center, magenta halo, and tiny violet arcs, isolated on transparent background.","targetId":"s023s2r3d2112","targetName":"EnergyOrb","request":"A round hot pink plasma orb with a white center, magenta halo, and tiny violet arcs, isolated on transparent background."},{"id":"a6e3r0q731r5m","kind":"image","name":"gold star","dataUrl":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","mime":"image/svg+xml","width":30,"height":30,"resolution":1,"centerX":15,"centerY":15,"description":"A golden five-point arcade star with beveled amber edges, a bright cream center, and a compact yellow halo, isolated on transparent background.","targetId":"s3f421x2l0917","targetName":"GoldStar","request":"A golden five-point arcade star with beveled amber edges, a bright cream center, and a compact yellow halo, isolated on transparent background."},{"id":"a4c1y5p5g4546","kind":"image","name":"cyan bolt","dataUrl":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","mime":"image/svg+xml","width":38,"height":16,"resolution":1,"centerX":19,"centerY":8,"description":"A horizontal neon cyan laser bolt pointing right, with a white-hot tip and a short electric blue tail fading into transparency.","targetId":"s6i5i0q6q3b5x","targetName":"LaserBolt","request":"A horizontal neon cyan laser bolt pointing right, with a white-hot tip and a short electric blue tail fading into transparency."},{"id":"a2d156h492k53","kind":"sound","name":"wave whoosh","dataUrl":"data:audio/wav;base64,","mime":"audio/wav","duration":1.0788662131519275,"description":"A short rising synthetic stereo sweep with a bright arcade shimmer at the crest, about 0.6 seconds.","targetId":"t610e6g0q3n40","targetName":"Stage","request":"A short rising synthetic stereo sweep with a bright arcade shimmer at the crest, about 0.6 seconds."},{"id":"a6y4p17146800","kind":"sound","name":"neon bass","dataUrl":"data:audio/wav;base64,","mime":"audio/wav","duration":11.42855,"description":"music: synthwave, pulsing analog bass arpeggio, crisp drum machine, bright retro chords, around 122 BPM, seamless loop.","targetId":"t610e6g0q3n40","targetName":"Stage","request":"music: synthwave, pulsing analog bass arpeggio, crisp drum machine, bright retro chords, around 122 BPM, seamless loop."}],"pieces":[{"key":"697fc02036f727af","kind":"rule","target":"Stage","block":"art style: [synthwave: deep purple space, a huge striped retro sun sinking into the horizon, a glowing pink and cyan grid racing toward it, bloom and a soft vignette on everything bright]","code":"const scene = this.game.scene;\nconst sky = scene.add.graphics().setDepth(-10).setScrollFactor(0);\nsky.fillGradientStyle(0x100721, 0x100721, 0x391050, 0x391050).fillRect(0, 0, 480, 360);\nfor (let i = 0; i < 95; i++) {\n  sky.fillStyle(i % 5 === 0 ? 0x56f6ff : 0xe6b5ff, 0.25 + (i % 4) * 0.15).fillCircle((i * 137) % 480, (i * 73) % 222, i % 5 === 0 ? 1.4 : 0.7);\n}\nfor (let y = -96; y < 57; y += 2) {\n  const stripe = y < -22 ? 16 : 11;\n  if (y > -52 && (y + 99) % stripe >= stripe - (y > 16 ? 5 : 3)) continue;\n  const w = Math.sqrt(98 * 98 - y * y);\n  const t = (y + 98) / 155;\n  sky.fillStyle(0xff0000 | (Math.round(218 - 171 * t) << 8) | Math.round(83 + 71 * t)).fillRect(240 - w, 164 + y, 2 * w, 2);\n}\nsky.fillGradientStyle(0x330d47, 0x330d47, 0x10051e, 0x10051e).fillRect(0, 220, 480, 140);\nsky.lineStyle(3, 0xff42be, 0.65).lineBetween(0, 220, 480, 220);\nfor (let i = -9; i <= 9; i++) {\n  const color = i % 2 ? 0x24eaff : 0xff48cf;\n  sky.lineStyle(5, color, 0.10).lineBetween(240 + i * 5, 220, 240 + i * 57, 360);\n  sky.lineStyle(1, color, 0.66).lineBetween(240 + i * 5, 220, 240 + i * 57, 360);\n}\nconst rows = Array.from({length: 14}, (_, i) => scene.add.rectangle(240, 220, 480, 2, i % 2 ? 0xff48cf : 0x24eaff).setDepth(-9).setScrollFactor(0));\nthis.game.camera.phaser.postFX?.addVignette?.(0.5, 0.5, 0.85, 0.24);\nfor (;;) {\n  rows.forEach((row, i) => {\n    const p = (i / rows.length + this.game.time * 0.7) % 1;\n    row.setPosition(240, 220 + 140 * p * p).setScale(1, 0.4 + p * 1.5).setAlpha(0.18 + p * 0.53);\n  });\n  yield;\n}"},{"key":"43b30c2476f14557","kind":"condition","target":"Stage","block":"[the comet has no lives left]","code":"return (this.game.vars.lives ?? 3) <= 0;"},{"key":"509930793acdb1fa","kind":"condition","target":"Stage","block":"[the Mothership has been destroyed]","code":"return this.game.vars.mothershipDestroyed === true;"},{"key":"ddc080d1c8de531c","kind":"rule","target":"Stage","block":"rule: [every 15 seconds a new wave starts: asteroids come faster and more often, and a big glowing \"WAVE 2\" (3, 4...) banner sweeps across the screen with a whoosh]","code":"const g = this.game;\ng.vars.wave = 1;\nfor (;;) {\n  const wave = 1 + Math.floor(g.time / 15);\n  if (wave !== g.vars.wave) {\n    g.vars.wave = wave;\n    this.playSound('wave whoosh');\n    const banner = g.scene.add.text(-180, 142, `WAVE ${wave}`, {fontFamily:'sans-serif', fontSize:'48px', fontStyle:'bold', color:'#fff1ff', stroke:'#a3189a', strokeThickness:6}).setOrigin(0.5).setScrollFactor(0).setDepth(100);\n    banner.setShadow(0, 0, '#ff4cce', 10, true, true);\n    this.run(function* () {\n      yield* this.tween(banner, {x:240}, 0.35, 'easeOut');\n      yield* this.wait(0.65);\n      yield* this.tween(banner, {x:660}, 0.35, 'easeIn');\n      banner.destroy();\n    });\n  }\n  yield;\n}"},{"key":"1325ae4c1aa7987d","kind":"rule","target":"Stage","block":"rule: [at wave 4 the Mothership arrives from the right: a huge glowing saucer with a health bar at the top of the screen; it drifts up and down, fires slow pink energy orbs at the comet, and flashes white when the laser hits it]","code":"const g = this.game;\nyield* this.waitUntil(() => (g.vars.wave ?? 1) >= 4);\nconst boss = g.spawn('Mothership', {x:335, y:0, visible:true});\nyield* boss.glideTo({x:150,y:0}, 2, 'easeOut');\nconst bar = g.scene.add.graphics().setDepth(95).setScrollFactor(0);\ng.ui.text('boss-label', 'MOTHERSHIP', {x:0,y:137,size:13,color:'#ff9be8',bold:true});\nlet fireAt = g.time + 0.65;\nconst arrived = g.time;\nwhile (!g.vars.mothershipDestroyed) {\n  boss.y = 83 * Math.sin((g.time - arrived) * 1.7);\n  bar.clear().fillStyle(0x371148).fillRoundedRect(146, 55, 188, 10, 5);\n  bar.fillStyle(0xff49c6).fillRoundedRect(148, 57, Math.max(1, 184 * boss.hp / 14), 6, 3);\n  if (g.time >= fireAt) {\n    const comet = g.find('Comet');\n    if (comet) g.spawn('EnergyOrb', {x:boss.x - 52, y:boss.y, visible:true});\n    fireAt = g.time + 0.95;\n  }\n  yield;\n}\nbar.destroy();\ng.ui.remove('boss-label');"},{"key":"6662bf9d29fdd324","kind":"rule","target":"Stage","block":"rule: [now and then a golden star drifts by; catching it sends out an expanding shockwave ring that blasts every asteroid on screen into confetti]","code":"const g = this.game;\nfor (;;) {\n  yield* this.wait(g.random(7, 12));\n  const star = g.spawn('GoldStar', {x:267, y:g.random(-121, 112), visible:true});\n  while (star.x > -267) {\n    star.x -= 93 * g.dt;\n    star.turn(85 * g.dt);\n    const comet = g.find('Comet');\n    if (comet && star.touching(comet)) {\n      comet.playSound('powerup');\n      const x = star.x, y = star.y;\n      const ring = g.scene.add.circle(x + 240, 180 - y, 10).setStrokeStyle(3, 0xffe073).setDepth(40);\n      this.run(function* () {\n        yield* this.tween(ring, {scaleX:60,scaleY:60,alpha:0}, 0.55, 'easeOut');\n        ring.destroy();\n      });\n      const view = g.camera.view();\n      for (const rock of g.findAll('Asteroid')) {\n        const r = 30 * rock.size / 100;\n        if (!rock.isClone || !rock.visible || rock.ndBlasted || rock.x + r < view.left || rock.x - r > view.right || rock.y + r < view.bottom || rock.y - r > view.top) continue;\n        rock.ndBlasted = true;\n        for (const color of ['#d359ff','#5bffff','#ffdb68']) g.effects.burst({x:rock.x,y:rock.y,color,count:5,speed:135,size:3,lifetime:0.45});\n        g.broadcast('nd-rock-blasted');\n        rock.destroy();\n      }\n      break;\n    }\n    yield;\n  }\n  star.destroy();\n}"},{"key":"70ae5d5572f47094","kind":"rule","target":"Stage","block":"rule: [the score is the seconds survived plus 50 for every asteroid blasted, shown big and glowing at the top center, with a combo multiplier that grows when you blast asteroids quickly one after another]","code":"const g = this.game;\nlet points = 0, combo = 0, last = -100, shown = '';\ng.vars.score = 0;\ng.on('nd-rock-blasted', () => {\n  combo = g.time - last <= 2 ? Math.min(6, combo + 1) : 1;\n  last = g.time;\n  points += 50 * combo;\n});\nconst hud = g.scene.add.text(240, 19, '', {fontFamily:'sans-serif',fontSize:'23px',fontStyle:'bold',color:'#d5ffff',stroke:'#4f176a',strokeThickness:4}).setOrigin(0.5).setDepth(90).setScrollFactor(0);\nhud.setShadow(0, 0, '#3cefff', 7, true, true);\nfor (;;) {\n  g.vars.score = Math.floor(g.time) + points;\n  const label = `SCORE ${g.vars.score}${combo > 1 && g.time - last <= 2 ? `  ×${combo}` : ''}`;\n  if (label !== shown) { shown = label; hud.setText(label); }\n  yield;\n}"},{"key":"e7416d361e5575d1","kind":"rule","target":"Stage","block":"rule: [a pulsing synthwave bass loop plays as music the whole game]","code":"this.game.music('neon bass');"},{"key":"eff8919a44982dd9","kind":"behavior","target":"Comet","block":"always: [glide smoothly toward the mouse, tilting the way I move, with a long glowing cyan trail of sparkles behind me]","code":"const g = this.game;\nconst trail = g.scene.add.particles(0, 0, 'amble-dot', {frequency:-1, speed:{min:12,max:55}, lifespan:{min:300,max:680}, scale:{start:0.65,end:0}, alpha:{start:0.75,end:0}, tint:[0x49f9ff,0x1daaff,0xb8ffff], blendMode:'ADD'}).setDepth(-1);\nlet tick = 0;\nfor (;;) {\n  const m = g.input.mouse;\n  const dx = Math.max(-209, Math.min(209, m.x)) - this.x;\n  const dy = Math.max(-149, Math.min(149, m.y)) - this.y;\n  const d = Math.hypot(dx, dy);\n  if (d > 0.5) {\n    const step = Math.min(d * (1 - Math.exp(-9 * g.dt)), 380 * g.dt);\n    this.setPosition(this.x + dx / d * step, this.y + dy / d * step);\n    const target = Math.atan2(dy, dx) * 180 / Math.PI;\n    const delta = ((target - this.angle + 540) % 360) - 180;\n    this.angle += delta * 0.22;\n  }\n  if (++tick % 2 === 0) {\n    const a = this.angle * Math.PI / 180;\n    trail.emitParticleAt(this.x + 240 - 21 * Math.cos(a), 180 - this.y + 21 * Math.sin(a), d > 4 ? 3 : 1);\n  }\n  yield;\n}"},{"key":"4ad4138e36dd55a3","kind":"rule","target":"Comet","block":"rule: [the comet has 3 lives, shown as little glowing hearts at the top right]","code":"const g = this.game;\ng.vars.lives ??= 3;\nconst hearts = g.scene.add.text(465, 19, '', {fontFamily:'sans-serif',fontSize:'22px',color:'#ff81c9',stroke:'#63104f',strokeThickness:3}).setOrigin(1, 0.5).setDepth(90).setScrollFactor(0);\nhearts.setShadow(0, 0, '#ff57b9', 8, true, true);\nlet previous = -1;\nfor (;;) {\n  if (previous !== g.vars.lives) {\n    previous = g.vars.lives;\n    const n = Math.max(0, Math.min(3, previous));\n    hearts.setText('♥'.repeat(n) + '♡'.repeat(3 - n));\n  }\n  yield;\n}"},{"key":"a87452cc429df18f","kind":"behavior","target":"Comet","block":"never: [leave the screen]","code":"for (;;) {\n  const v = this.game.camera.view();\n  const r = 38 * this.size / 100;\n  this.setPosition(Math.max(v.left + r, Math.min(v.right - r, this.x)), Math.max(v.bottom + r, Math.min(v.top - r, this.y)));\n  yield;\n}"},{"key":"50cb85e2ec8441fb","kind":"action","target":"Comet","block":"do [fire a bright cyan laser bolt straight ahead that shatters the first asteroid it hits into glowing purple rubble]","code":"const g = this.game;\nthis.ndNextShot ??= 0;\nif (g.time < this.ndNextShot) return;\nthis.ndNextShot = g.time + 0.15;\nconst a = this.angle * Math.PI / 180;\nthis.shoot('LaserBolt', {at:this.angle, speed:680, range:590, from:{x:this.x + 21 * Math.cos(a), y:this.y + 21 * Math.sin(a)}, hits:['Asteroid','Mothership'], onHit:(target) => {\n  if (!target.isClone || !target.visible) return false;\n  if (target.name === 'Mothership') {\n    if (!target.ndReady || target.hp <= 0) return false;\n    target.takeLaser();\n    return;\n  }\n  if (target.ndBlasted) return false;\n  target.ndBlasted = true;\n  g.effects.burst({x:target.x,y:target.y,color:'#c767ff',count:16,speed:140,size:4,lifetime:0.4});\n  g.broadcast('nd-rock-blasted');\n  target.destroy();\n}});"},{"key":"5f1e3480946383cd","kind":"condition","target":"Comet","block":"[I'm not blinking]","code":"return this.game.time >= (this.ndBlinkUntil ?? 0) && (this.game.vars.lives ?? 3) > 0;"},{"key":"a48bfe633bbdfc62","kind":"action","target":"Comet","block":"particles: [a burst of hot pink sparks]","code":"this.game.effects.burst({x:this.x,y:this.y,color:'#ff37ae',count:20,speed:155,size:3,lifetime:0.38});"},{"key":"9faed7583a63b43d","kind":"action","target":"Comet","block":"do [lose a life, then blink for 1 second (asteroids can't hurt me while I blink)]","code":"const g = this.game;\nif (g.time < (this.ndBlinkUntil ?? 0) || (g.vars.lives ?? 3) <= 0) return;\nthis.ndBlinkUntil = g.time + 1;\ng.vars.lives = Math.max(0, (g.vars.lives ?? 3) - 1);\nwhile (g.time < this.ndBlinkUntil) {\n  this.opacity = Math.floor((this.ndBlinkUntil - g.time) * 12) % 2 ? 0.24 : 1;\n  yield;\n}\nthis.opacity = 1;"},{"key":"20f2bfbd50024ca8","kind":"value","target":"Asteroid","block":"[a little less time each wave, starting at 1 second]","code":"return Math.max(0.32, 1 / (1 + 0.23 * ((this.game.vars.wave ?? 1) - 1)));"},{"key":"f3cdb5855f4f35d2","kind":"action","target":"Asteroid","block":"do [start just past the right edge at a random height, with a random size and spin]","code":"const g = this.game;\nthis.size = g.random(57, 113);\nthis.setPosition(g.camera.view().right + 36, g.random(-138, 138));\nthis.angle = g.random(0, 359);\nthis.ndSpin = g.random(35, 125) * (g.random(0, 1) ? 1 : -1);\nthis.ndBlasted = false;"},{"key":"5db7e1d1f61f2922","kind":"condition","target":"Asteroid","block":"[I'm past the left edge]","code":"return this.x < this.game.camera.view().left - 38;"},{"key":"b88fd2939418c5d8","kind":"action","target":"Asteroid","block":"do [drift left at this wave's speed, spinning]","code":"const g = this.game;\nthis.x -= Math.min(245, 105 + 29 * ((g.vars.wave ?? 1) - 1)) * g.dt;\nthis.turn((this.ndSpin ?? 75) * g.dt);"}],"brief":"game: [steer a tiny comet through a neon asteroid storm, blast your way through the waves, then defeat the Mothership]\nmade for: [anyone who likes flashy arcade games]\nart style: [synthwave: deep purple space, a huge striped retro sun sinking into the horizon, a glowing pink and cyan grid racing toward it, bloom and a soft vignette on everything bright]","style":"art style: [synthwave: deep purple space, a huge striped retro sun sinking into the horizon, a glowing pink and cyan grid racing toward it, bloom and a soft vignette on everything bright]","revised":[],"questions":[],"issues":[]}}